<title>JAPAN: Royal amends 6-month dividend figure.</title>
<headline>Royal amends 6-month dividend figure.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Ltd on Tuesday corrected its half-year dividend to 7.50 yen for the six months to September from its earlier announced dividend figure of 7.00 yen.</p>
<p>The wholesaler and retailer of car parts and equipment made the correction after announcing its half-year earnings and dividend figures on November 15.</p>
